data: {"id": "119ea61b5e944719-thinking-parallel_evidence-243", "run_id": "119ea61b5e944719", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，先确认第一轮可观测性基线结果，再并行补充 Kubernetes 侧的关键事实（describe、yaml、events）。\n\n**第一轮可观测性基线事实汇总**\n- **Metrics (Prometheus)**: \n  - `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (reason=\"ContainerCreating\")，容器未启动。\n  - `kube_pod_status_phase=1` (phase=\"Pending\")。\n  - `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total=0`，无重启。\n- **Logging (Elasticsearch)**:\n  - 30分钟窗口内 0 条日志，说明容器未运行。\n- **Tracing (DeepFlow/Tempo)**:\n  - DeepFlow 和 Tempo 均无数据，因为 `pod_ip` 为空（容器未分配 IP）。\n\n接下来，我需要获取 Pod 的 Describe、YAML 和 Events 来定位 `ContainerCre", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788782019266, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

