 aiops-case-05 命名空间中不存在 → Multus CNI 插件无法获取网络配置并执行 add 操作 → 容器运行时无法创建 Pod Sandbox (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → Pod aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx 持续处于 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：Pod YAML 中引用的 Multus 网络附加定义（`unavailable-network`）在目标命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中不存在。\n\n这一配置错误导致 Multus 插件在初始化网络时查无此定义，进而使 Kubelet 的 `CreatePodSandbox` 调用失败。由于网络配置是 Pod 启动的必要前提，该错误直接导致容器始终无法完成初始化并进入 `ContainerCreating` 状态。证据 2 (K8s Event) 与证据 3 (K8s Event) 相互印证了这一因果链条。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 64.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx: 64.1s (Evidence 56.4s, RCA 7.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 97.935, "metrics": {"run_id": "119ea61b5e944719", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 97.94345688819885, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.1